The Da Vinci Code is a thriller, mystery film directed by Ron Howard.

3
00:16:33,333 --> 00:16:39,333
A murder in Paris’ Louvre Museum and cryptic clues in some of Leonardo da Vinci’s
most famous paintings lead to the discovery of a religious mystery.

4
00:22:04,444 --> 00:22:10,444
For 2,000 years a secret society closely guards information that — should it
come to light — could rock the very foundations of Christianity.

5
